"use": "コンテナ船 (a coastal container feeder, 150 x 24 m): a STATIC walkable level, not controllable -- holds of stacked containers, two deck cranes, the forecastle, the aft accommodation house (mess, cabins, the captain's safe and a weapon cache, the wheelhouse with wings) over the engine room. Origin on the WATERLINE at midships (place it with y = the sea surface), the bow toward +Z (Blender -Y). Not placed on the island: a level designer's building. kits/interiors/CargoShip.blend",
